  const generated=base==null?[]:[[0,'At set time'],[30,'30 min before set'],[60,'1 hour before set'],[120,'2 hours before set'],[180,'3 hours before set']].map(([mins,label]: any)=>({at:base-mins*60000,label})).filter((o: any)=>o.at>now);
